+### Fix I would make
+
+Do not call `usdt.approve(...)` directly. Use OpenZeppelin `SafeERC20.forceApprove` or another USDT-compatible allowance flow. Prefer setting the Aave allowance once, or increasing it only when needed, with a helper that is safe for tokens that return no value and tokens that require zeroing before changing a nonzero allowance.
