+### Fix I would make
+
+Define who owns fees explicitly. If fees are meant for remaining shareholders, waive or redirect the withdrawal fee when a withdrawal burns the final shares. If fees are meant for the protocol, withdraw or transfer the fee to a treasury address instead of leaving it inside the vault with no shares. In either design, add an invariant that `totalShares == 0` cannot coexist with a positive unowned aUSDT balance.
